  "title": "Delicious Grilled Turkey Burgers",
  "description": "These moist, grilled turkey burgers with red onion, Dijon mustard, and sour cream are topped with Swiss cheese and served on soft Hawaiian-style buns.",
  "authors": [
    "katquilter"
  ],
